        "description": {
            "value": "<p>The outlines of topographical maps are burned into this wooden staff's surface, though they constantly change to reflect the surrounding terrain. While wielding this staff, you get a +2 circumstance bonus to Survival checks to Sense Direction or Subsist in the wild.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Cantrip</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Know the Way]</p></li><li><p><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Alarm], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Breadcrumbs]</p></li><li><p><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Create Food], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Environmental Endurance], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Marvelous Mount]</p></li></ul><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.</p>"
